# L §8.2 before from:, E §9 item 3 (tally 2.1.7 R7, issue #146; P46): a base movement before from that the
# branch doesn't book (a decision whose projection the branch changed) is listed, `before from: <instance> on
# <day> removed by <branch>`, under the reads of the places it touched. 2.1.6's refcore listed nothing. (T's G14
# g6f3.)
=== g6f3_m.tally
model decided
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "G14 probe, G6 fix 3: a decision whose projection reads the scenario's rows; from T's vector from M1's property scenario-before-19 (issue #108, invented): law_after.tally's movement before from, read at a law date after it, with a decision before from beside it; E 9 item 3 lists the movement whatever else ran before from"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place savings: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input floor: money PLN

input bill_day: date

input horizon: date

input sweep_day: date

move bill: transfers
  on bill_day
  at bill_day
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee

move sweep: transfers
  on sweep_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, low(konto, sweep_day .. horizon) from sweep_day - floor)

ask b0: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = 100.00 "the fee"
  floor = 50.00 "the sweep's floor"
  opening[konto] = 200.00 at 2026-01-01 start "the opening"
  opening[savings] = 0.00 at 2026-01-01 start "the opening"
  horizon = 2026-12-31 "the horizon"
  bill_day = 2026-09-01 "the bill's day, after from"
  sweep_day = 2026-04-01 "the decision's day, before from"
=== g6f3_s.tally
scenario more over decided
  tally 2
  from 2026-07-01

version more_fee
  cite card
  governs 2026-07-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace fee = 150.00 "the scenario's fee"

ask b1: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) in more
=== expect b1
b1: 200.00 PLN
  world: more
  before from: sweep on 2026-04-01 removed by more
  cut 2026-03-01
